title: J2735 High-Performance Toolkit
version: 0.1.0
date-released: '2026-01-01'
url: 'https://github.com/xqgex/J2735-High-Performance-Toolkit'
license: Apache-2.0
type: software
abstract: >-
  Zero-copy, bit-level parser for SAE J2735 UPER-encoded
  messages, optimized for embedded systems and V2X
  applications. Implements alignment-safe, endianness-aware
  parsing without heap allocation.
